  prune   Retire the transcripts of sessions nobody has written to for a while, and say what went (nxf 6j6v.t7pa). WHOLE sessions, aged on their LAST recorded entry — a session still being written to is never a candidate, however long it has been running, and a long-running one is never cut in half
  help    Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --json     Emit machine-readable JSON instead of human output
      --db <DB>  Use this sqlite db file directly instead of discovering `.nxs/` [env: NXC_DB=]
